</functional_risks>
<verification_requirements>
Verify departure date input retains ISO format after initialization and when moving through field without selecting a date. Verify form submission includes departure date in ISO format. Verify return date input (with explicit dateFormat) shows long format. Verify datepickers with explicit dateFormat work correctly. Verify keyboard navigation and date selection function as expected.
</verification_requirements>
